descriptions.job-0e6o80n:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Founded in Silicon Valley in 2009 by Marc Andreessen and Ben Horowitz, Andreessen Horowitz (aka a16z) is a venture capital firm that backs bold entrepreneurs &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/news-content&quot;&gt;building the future&lt;/a&gt; through technology. We are &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/portfolio&quot;&gt;stage agnostic&lt;/a&gt;. We invest in seed to venture to &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/growth/&quot;&gt;growth-stage technology&lt;/a&gt; companies, across &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/ai/&quot;&gt;AI&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/bio-health/&quot;&gt;bio + healthcare&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/consumer/&quot;&gt;consumer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16zcrypto.com/&quot;&gt;crypto&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/enterprise/&quot;&gt;enterprise&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/fintech/&quot;&gt;fintech&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/games&quot;&gt;games&lt;/a&gt;, and companies building toward &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/american-dynamism/&quot;&gt;American dynamism&lt;/a&gt;. a16z has $100B+ under management across multiple funds.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We’ve established a team that &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/about/&quot;&gt;is defined by&lt;/a&gt; respect for the entrepreneur and the company-building process; we know what it’s like to be in the founder’s shoes. We’ve invested in &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/portfolio/&quot;&gt;companies&lt;/a&gt; like Anduril, Airbnb, Coinbase, Cursor, Databricks, Deel, Figma, GitHub, Roblox, SpaceX, and Stripe. Our team is at the forefront of new technology, helping founders and their companies impact and change the world.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;The Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;You will join the Applied Software Group (ASG), a team of experienced individual contributors building internal software tools for the firm&#39;s investing and operations teams. As a software engineer optimizing developer experience, you will own, improve and help with the adoption of our internal developer platform as well as the team&#39;s wider product portfolio. You will work on and own the infrastructure and tooling that the team and its partners are building with.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;The Applied Software Group operates in the mode of an internal startup. We own a tight feedback loop with our users and take on requests from all corners of the firm. In this role, your users are your fellow colleagues — you&#39;ll understand their pain points, eliminate friction from their daily workflows, and build the platform and tools that lets everyone build more, faster, and with confidence. While doing so, you will closely work together with your fellow engineers and other teams throughout the firm.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;This role requires an in-office presence 2-3 days a week in our San Francisco, CA office.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;To join our team, you should be excited to:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Contribute to and help improve the our developer platform, associated with a diverse set of applications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Continuously work with your fellow colleagues to understand, review and assist their diverse use-cases for projects&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Build and maintain shared tooling, templates, and internal libraries that accelerate development across the firm’s products&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Support observability, monitoring, and alerting so engineers can self-serve when things break in production&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Collaborate with the Cybersecurity team to help ensure developer workflows meet security and compliance requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Write and maintain developer documentation, onboarding guides, and runbooks that actually get used&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Ship improvements iteratively, incorporating feedback from your users to continuously improve the developer experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Take ownership of assigned projects and services, from development through production support, with increasing autonomy over time&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Write clear, well-structured, and maintainable code&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Bring positive energy in every interaction with the team and foster inclusive collaboration&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Stay curious about new tools, technologies, and approaches relevant to infrastructure and developer productivity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Learn the inner workings of VC and work closely with the investing partnership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Minimum Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;3+ years of professional software engineering experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Proficiency in Python 3, Rust or similar backend languages and willingness to learn new technologies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Track record of defining and shipping developer platforms or internal tooling that measurably improved engineering velocity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Excitement to work directly with a diverse user group with varying technical backgrounds&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Experience deploying services on at least one major cloud platform (GCP, AWS, or Azure)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Experience with containerized services (Docker); experience with Kubernetes is a plus&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Exposure to CI/CD systems (GitHub Actions, Cloud Build, CircleCI, or similar)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Experience working with production SQL databases (e.g., PostgreSQL, MySQL); NoSQL experience (e.g., Elasticsearch) is a plus&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Experience with infrastructure-as-code concepts (Terraform, Pulumi, or similar) is a plus&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Experience working in environments that value rapid iteration, code quality, and operational excellence&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Strong problem-solving skills and solid technical fundamentals with a get-it-done mentality&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Low ego, high empathy, and the capacity to collaborate effectively with diverse teams&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;This role is open at the Software Engineer (Partner 16) and Senior Software Engineer (Partner 18) levels. The anticipated salary range for this role is between:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Software Engineer (Partner 16): $269,000 - $314,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Senior Software Engineer (Partner 18): $301,000 - $352,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Final compensation will be determined based on a candidate&#39;s overall experience, technical depth, and interview performance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;This role is eligible to participate in the a16z Carry program and various discretionary bonus programs as well as benefit and perquisite plans including health, dental, vision, disability, life insurance, 401K plan, vacation, and sick leave.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;a16z culture&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We do only first class business and only in a first class way&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We take a long view of relationships, because we are in the relationship business&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We believe in the future and bet the firm that way&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We are all different, we recognize that, and we win&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We celebrate the good times&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We do it for the team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We play to win&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;At a16z we are always looking to hire the absolute best talent and recognize that diversity in our experiences and backgrounds is what makes us stronger. We hire candidates of any race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, gender identity, age, marital or family status, disability, Veteran status, and any other status. These differences are what enables us to work towards the future we envision for ourselves, our portfolio companies, and the World.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Our organization participates in E-Verify. Click&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.e-verify.gov/employees&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.e-verify.gov/employees&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1674233464432000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw1-yT1T3ug2xE734Ge62fLD&quot;&gt; here&lt;/a&gt; to learn about E-Verify.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Andreessen Horowitz hereby reserves the right to make use of any unsolicited resumes received from outside recruiting agencies and / or individual recruiters without being responsible for payment of any fees asserted from the use of unsolicited resumes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-13prk9j:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;O nás&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Spoločnosť Localcoin bola založená v roku 2017 a jej hlavné sídlo sa nachádza v Toronte v Kanade. Naším cieľom je urobiť nákup a predaj digitálnych mien jednoduchým a dostupným pre každého. Spolupracujeme s maloobchodnými partnermi, aby sme služby v oblasti digitálnych mien sprístupnili väčšiemu počtu ľudí po celom svete.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vďaka bitcoinovým bankomatom v Kanade, Poľsku, Austrálii, Hongkongu a na Novom Zélande je Localcoin jedným z najrýchlejšie rastúcich prevádzkovateľov bitcoinových bankomatov na svete.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Veríme, že každý by mal mať možnosť používať kryptomeny a zoznámiť sa s technológiou blockchain. Keď sa pridáte k spoločnosti Localcoin, stanete sa súčasťou rastúceho tímu, ktorý podporuje vzdelávanie, spoluprácu a profesionálny rozvoj.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ak ste motivovaní, máte chuť učiť sa a baví vás práca v rýchlo rastúcom a inovatívnom prostredí, radi by sme vás spoznali.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;O pozícii&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Localcoin sa po prvýkrát rozširuje na Slovensko – a hľadáme nášho prvého obchodného zástupcu, ktorý tento trh vybuduje od základov.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ide o jedinečnú príležitosť etablovať Localcoin na Slovensku, nadviazať partnerstvá s maloobchodníkmi a pomôcť formovať našu stratégiu rastu v novom regióne. Ako prvý zamestnanec na tomto trhu budete zodpovedný nielen za získavanie prvotriednych maloobchodných priestorov pre naše Bitcoinové kiosky a produkty, ale aj za budovanie silných vzťahov, reprezentovanie našej značky na miestnej úrovni a vytváranie základov pre budúcu expanziu.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ak ste motivovaní, viete riešiť problémy a tešíte sa na to, že budete pomáhať udávať smer v oblasti digitálnych mien, táto pozícia vám dáva šancu mať skutočný vplyv už od prvého dňa.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Podrobnosti o pracovnej ponuke&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Miesto výkonu práce:&lt;/strong&gt; Práca na diaľku v rámci Slovenska, s častými služobnými cestami po celom Slovensku.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Typ zmluvy:&lt;/strong&gt; Pracovný pomer na dobu určitú, na plný úväzok&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Trvanie zmluvy:&lt;/strong&gt; Počiatočná pracovná zmluva na dobu určitú na 6 mesiacov s možnosťou predĺženia alebo premeny na pracovný pomer na dobu neurčitú na základe potrieb spoločnosti a výkonnosti.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Plat:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;2 900 – 3 200 € hrubého mesačne. Počiatočný plat v rámci tohto rozpätia bude stanovený na základe objektívnych kritérií relevantných pre danú pozíciu, vrátane príslušných skúseností, zručností a kvalifikácie.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Variabilná odmena:&lt;/strong&gt; Nárok na provízie/bonusy založené na výkone v súlade s platným motivačným programom spoločnosti Localcoin.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pracovná doba:&lt;/strong&gt; Štandardná pracovná doba s príležitostnými stretnutiami v skorých večerných hodinách na podporu spolupráce s kanadskými tímami.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Povinnosti&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Riadiť celý predajný proces od vyhľadávania nových partnerov a nadväzovania kontaktu s nimi až po rokovania, podpisovanie zmlúv a následnú podporu partnerov.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vyhľadávanie nových obchodných príležitostí prostredníctvom studenej akvizície, návštev na mieste a priameho oslovovania. Vedenie kvalitného zoznamu potenciálnych partnerov.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Budovanie silných vzťahov s partnermi a udržiavanie pravidelného kontaktu s cieľom zabezpečiť ich spokojnosť a rozvíjať partnerstvo.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Zastupovanie spoločnosti Localcoin na Slovensku prostredníctvom vysvetľovania našich produktov, ich výhod a budovania dôvery u nových partnerov.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pomoc partnerom pri žiadostiach, ako sú zmeny vlastníctva, presťahovanie prevádzky alebo renovácia.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hľadanie spôsobov, ako rozvíjať existujúce partnerstvá ponúkaním ďalších produktov alebo služieb.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spolupracujte s prevádzkovými, predajnými a finančnými tímami v centrále, aby ste zaistili správnu aktualizáciu informácií o partneroch a zmluvách v našich systémoch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pomáhajte riešiť technické problémy a zložitejšie záležitosti smerujte na príslušný tím.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pravidelne cestujte do prevádzok partnerov na stretnutia, kontroly prevádzok a obnovovanie zmlúv.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sledujte trendy v maloobchode a fintechu, konkurenciu a meniace sa potreby zákazníkov.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plňte mesačné predajné ciele a KPI a pomáhajte zlepšovať náš predajný prístup na Slovensku.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kvalifikácia&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Viac ako 3 roky skúseností v oblasti B2B predaja a správy zákazníckych účtov, ideálne v maloobchode, franšízach, platobnom styku/fintechu alebo v oblasti maloobchodných nehnuteľností.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Schopnosť pohodlne pracovať na novom trhu, kde sa procesy ešte len vyvíjajú.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skúsenosti s používaním CRM nástrojov, ako sú Salesforce alebo HubSpot.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Priateľský prístup a orientácia na zákazníka, spolu so silnými vyjednávacími schopnosťami a schopnosťou riešiť problémy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vynikajúca znalosť slovenčiny a dobrá pracovná znalosť angličtiny.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dobrá znalosť balíka Microsoft Office (Word, PowerPoint a Excel).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preukázaná schopnosť plniť alebo prekračovať predajné ciele.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dobrá znalosť alebo silný záujem o kryptomeny a fintech.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Platný vodičský preukaz skupiny B a schopnosť pravidelne cestovať po celom Slovensku; je potrebný prístup k spoľahlivému vozidlu.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Zákonné oprávnenie pracovať na Slovensku.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vítané kvalifikácie&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skúsenosti so zavádzaním alebo rozširovaním nového produktu/služby na Slovensku.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Znalosť franšízových maloobchodných sietí, sietí obchodov s rýchlym občerstvením, potravinárskych sietí alebo sietí stánkov.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Porozumenie regulačnému kontextu (AML/CTF, ochrana spotrebiteľa, súlad s predpismi EÚ) v oblasti finančných služieb/kryptomien.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Umelá inteligencia v náborovom procese&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;V rámci nášho náborového procesu môžeme využívať technológie, vrátane nástrojov podporovaných umelou inteligenciou, na podporu určitých administratívnych a výberových činností. Tieto nástroje podporujú, ale nenahrádzajú ľudské rozhodovanie. Rozhodnutia o prijatí do zamestnania prijímajú kvalifikovaní členovia nášho tímu.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Zamestnávateľ podporujúci rovnosť príležitostí&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Spoločnosť Localcoin sa zaväzuje k rovnosti príležitostí a spravodlivému, inkluzívnemu náborovému procesu. Uvítame prihlášky od kvalifikovaných uchádzačov bez ohľadu na pohlavie, rod, vek, rasu alebo etnický pôvod, národnosť, náboženstvo alebo vieru, zdravotné postihnutie, sexuálnu orientáciu alebo akúkoľvek inú charakteristiku chránenú príslušnými slovenskými a európskymi právnymi predpismi.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;--&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Localcoin was founded in 2017 and is headquartered in Toronto, Canada. Our goal is to make buying and selling digital currencies simple and accessible for everyone. We work with retail partners to bring digital currency services to more people around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With Bitcoin ATMs across Canada, Poland, Australia, Hong Kong, and New Zealand, Localcoin is one of the fastest-growing Bitcoin ATM operators globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe everyone should have the opportunity to use cryptocurrency and learn about blockchain technology. When you join Localcoin, you become part of a growing team that supports learning, collaboration, and professional development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are motivated, eager to learn, and enjoy working in a fast-growing and innovative environment, we would love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Localcoin is expanding into Slovakia for the very first time—and we’re looking for our first Account Executive to build this market from the ground up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a unique opportunity to establish Localcoin’s presence in Slovakia, establish our retail partnerships, and help shape our growth strategy in a new region. As the first hire in this market, you’ll not only be responsible for acquiring prime retail space for our Bitcoin Kiosks and products but also for building strong relationships, representing our brand locally, and creating the foundation for future expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re motivated, good at solving problems, and excited to help lead the way in digital currency, this role gives you the chance to make a real impact from day one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Remote within Slovakia, with frequent business travel throughout Slovakia.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contract Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Fixed-term, full-time employment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contract Term:&lt;/strong&gt; Initial 6-month fixed-term employment agreement, with the possibility of extension or conversion to indefinite-term employment based on business needs and performance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary: &lt;/strong&gt;€2,900–€3,200 gross per month. The starting salary within this range will be determined based on objective, role-relevant criteria, including relevant experience, skills, and qualifications.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Variable Compensation:&lt;/strong&gt; Eligible for performance-based commission/bonus in accordance with Localcoin&#39;s applicable incentive plan.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working Hours:&lt;/strong&gt; Standard business hours with occasional early evening meetings to support collaboration with Canadian teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the full sales process from finding new partners and contacting them to negotiating, signing contracts, and supporting them afterward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Find new business opportunities through cold calls, visits to locations, and direct outreach. Keep a strong list of potential partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong relationships with partners and stay in regular contact to keep them satisfied and grow the partnership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Localcoin in Slovakia by explaining our products, their benefits, and building trust with new partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help partners with requests such as ownership changes, moving locations, or renovations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Find ways to grow existing partnerships by offering additional products or services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with operations, sales, and finance teams at HQ to make sure partner and contract information is correctly updated in our systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help solve technical problems and send more complex issues to the right team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel regularly to partner locations for meetings, location checks, and contract renewals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep up with retail and fintech trends, competitors, and changing customer needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meet monthly sales goals and KPIs and help improve our sales approach in Slovakia.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in B2B sales and account management, ideally in retail, franchises, payments/fintech, or retail real estate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working in a new market where processes are still being developed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using CRM tools such as Salesforce or HubSpot.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Friendly and customer-focused, with strong negotiation and problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent Slovak and good working English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good knowledge of Microsoft Office (Word, PowerPoint, and Excel).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to meet or exceed sales targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good knowledge of or strong interest in cryptocurrency and fintech.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Valid Category B driver&#39;s licence and ability to travel regularly throughout Slovakia; access to a reliable vehicle is required.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Legal right to work in Slovakia.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-to-Have Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in launching or scaling a new product/service in Slovakia.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with franchise retail, convenience, grocery, or kiosk networks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of regulatory context (AML/CTF, consumer protection, EU compliance) in financial services/crypto.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI in Recruitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We may use technology, including AI-assisted tools, to support certain administrative and screening activities during our recruitment process. These tools support, but do not replace, human decision-making. Hiring decisions are made by qualified members of our team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Localcoin is committed to equal opportunity and a fair, inclusive recruitment process. We welcome applications from qualified candidates regardless of sex, gender, age, race or ethnic origin, nationality, religion or belief, disability, sexual orientation, or any other characteristic protected by applicable Slovak and EU law.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

descriptions.job-1wecxcn:
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Stripe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies - from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups - use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone&#39;s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Recruiting team builds Stripe’s culture by connecting exceptional talent with our highest-impact business needs. We bring Stripe’s operating principles to life through thoughtful, consistent hiring practices, a high-quality candidate experience, and data-informed partnership with the business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe is looking for a strategic, consultative, independent and creative recruiter to support hiring for our our Risk, Partnerships and Operations functions in the APAC region. You will partner with senior global leaders who shape Stripe’s financial strategy, external narrative, long-term growth, and company-wide decision-making.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-impact portfolio supporting varied talent markets, senior stakeholders, and roles where the quality of each hire can influence how Stripe operates and grows. You will own full-cycle recruiting, advise leaders on hiring strategy and market conditions, and build trusted relationships with candidates and hiring teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with senior leaders to understand business priorities, define hiring plans, and develop recruiting strategies that support headcount goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the full recruiting lifecycle, from intake and sourcing through offer acceptance and onboarding handoff.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively advise and educate hiring teams on APAC talent-market conditions, candidate availability, competitive dynamics, and hiring approaches for specialized and senior roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute sourcing strategies that build broad, qualified candidate pipelines for current and future hiring needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong candidate relationships and deliver a thoughtful, timely candidate experience throughout the process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use recruiting data to track progress, identify risks and opportunities, and provide clear updates to business leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve recruiting processes where needed, testing practical changes that help hiring teams move with clarity and consistency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with cross-functional teams, including Comp, People Operations, Benefits, Onboarding, and Legal, to support a smooth offer and onboarding experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Uphold structured, competency-based hiring practices and help hiring teams assess candidates against the requirements of each role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. If you meet these requirements, you are encouraged to apply. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of full-cycle recruiting experience in a fast-paced, high-growth environment, including in-house recruiting experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience partnering with senior leaders on hiring strategy, talent-market insights, and complex searches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to seamlessly context switch to support a breadth of roles across a wide variety of functions and hiring managers.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to build trust with senior stakeholders and influence decisions through sound judgment, data, and market knowledge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing AI first sourcing and talent mapping strategies and engaging candidates for specialized or senior roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to use recruiting data to identify trends, communicate progress, and improve recruiting outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational skills and the ability to manage multiple searches and shifting priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative approach and comfort working across functions to solve problems and improve the hiring experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity about emerging AI tools and a practical approach to testing and adopting new ways of working.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience recruiting for complex business functions or other specialized functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting senior-level hiring or roles with complex stakeholder groups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working across multiple geographies or advising on location strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with recruiting systems and sourcing tools, including applicant tracking systems, candidate relationship management tools, and LinkedIn Recruiter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of the APAC region (preferably including experience working across Southeast Asia and/or India)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

descriptions.job-1g76byv:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fireblocks is the company bringing global finance onchain. Backed by over $1 billion in capital, we are the premier digital asset infrastructure provider trusted by thousands of industry-defining financial institutions, including banks, payment providers, fintechs, and global corporates such as BNY Mellon, BNP Paribas, ANZ Bank, Western Union, Stripe, and Revolut. Built for institutional scale and security, our enterprise-grade platform and network have powered over $14 trillion in digital asset transfers worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fireblocks Liechtenstein Ltd. is a payment institution being established to provide Account Information Services (AIS) and Payment Initiation Services (PIS) to institutional clients across the European Economic Area, under authorisation from the Liechtenstein Financial Market Authority (FMA).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Director of Operations is a controlling-function role and a member of the Company’s executive management. The role holds primary day-to-day accountability for the sound operation of the licensed entity, acts as the principal local point of contact with the FMA, and provides the substance and operational governance that underpin the Company’s authorisation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role has a defined and focused scope: the Company provides AIS and PIS services, with its technology platform operated by an intra-group technology provider. The Director of Operations is responsible for governing that arrangement and ensuring the entity operates soundly, rather than for building or running technology directly. The role may also support the Fireblocks group’s wider regulated activities where relevant.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regulatory and Governance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary day-to-day point of contact with the FMA for operational matters, managing the ongoing supervisory relationship.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the Company operates at all times within the scope and conditions of its authorisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the Company’s regulatory reporting obligations and coordinate the annual statutory and regulatory audit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the Board and executive management in discharging their governance responsibilities, including preparation and follow-through on Board matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Oversight&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold day-to-day accountability for the operational delivery of the Company’s AIS and PIS services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the outsourcing arrangement with the technology provider, including monitoring of service levels, quarterly service reviews, and management of the outsourcing register and sub-outsourcing controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the Company’s business continuity and incident management framework, acting as the escalation and decision point in the event of a material disruption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the segregated operational processes that support the Company’s regulatory perimeter, including customer onboarding, support routing, and data governance in coordination with the Risk &amp;amp; Compliance function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Risk and Control&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the Risk &amp;amp; Compliance function to ensure an effective control environment across AML/CFT, operational, ICT, and outsourcing risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the Company meets its obligations under applicable Liechtenstein and EEA regulation, including PSD2/ZDG and, as applicable, DORA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the maintenance of the Company’s risk register and the periodic and permanent control framework.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial and Financial Governance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the commercial and financial governance of the entity, including the intra-group service arrangements, in coordination with group finance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide operational sign-off on customer onboarding to the entity, ensuring the dual-entity contracting process is completed and customers are correctly provisioned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the Fireblocks group’s wider regulated activities where relevant, bringing operational and regulatory experience to bear.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven operational leadership experience within a regulated financial institution — a payment institution, e-money institution, bank, or crypto-asset service provider.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of the Liechtenstein or wider EEA regulatory environment, ideally including prior involvement in a licence application and ongoing regulator engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A payments background, with an understanding of open banking (AIS/PIS), payment operations, and the associated regulatory obligations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with outsourcing governance and the operation of a licensed entity that relies on an intra-group or third-party technology provider.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to the digital asset sector is an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Attributes&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The standing and seniority to act credibly as a controlling function before the FMA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sound judgement, personal accountability, and the ability to operate as the responsible individual for a licensed entity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to work effectively with a distributed group, including colleagues in other time zones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fit and proper for a controlling-function role, satisfying the FMA’s suitability assessment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location and Presence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role does not require full-time residence in Liechtenstein. The successful candidate may be resident in Liechtenstein or a neighbouring jurisdiction (Switzerland).The candidate must be willing to travel to Liechtenstein as required and to accommodate periodic working hours aligned with a US-headquartered group.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;For employees hired to work from the EU, Fireblocks is required by law to include a reasonable estimate of the compensation range for this role. This range is specific to Switzerland and takes into consideration a wide range of factors that are reviewed when making a hiring decision, such as years of experience, skills, and other business needs. It is not typical for a candidate to be hired at or near the top of the pay range and each compensation decision is dependent on each individual case. A reasonable base salary range estimate for this position is&lt;/em&gt; &lt;em&gt;€150,000 – €205,000. The base salary is one component of the total compensation package, which for some roles may include a target bonus, a very competitive equity grant, and very generous benefits.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;While we believe competitive compensation is a critical aspect of your decision to join us, we do hope you also spend time considering why our mission and culture are right for you. We are creating something transformational here, and we hope you are as excited about the future as we are.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fireblocks&#39; mission is to enable every business to easily and securely access digital assets and cryptocurrencies. In order to do that, we strongly believe our workforce should be as diverse as our clients, and this is why we embrace diversity and inclusion in all its forms. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fireblocks&#39; mission is to enable every business to easily and securely access digital assets and cryptocurrencies. In order to do that, we strongly believe&amp;nbsp;our workforce should be as diverse as our clients, and this is why we&amp;nbsp;embrace diversity and inclusion in all its forms.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h6&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.fireblocks.com/candidate-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Please see our candidate privacy policy here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-1tar2vr:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Plume&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Plume, we believe that technology isn&#39;t about moving faster, it&#39;s about making life’s moments better. Which is why we’ve built the world&#39;s first, and only, open and hardware-independent service delivery platform for smart homes, small businesses, enterprises, and beyond. Our SaaS platform uses WiFi, advanced AI, and machine learning to create the future of connected spaces—and human experiences—at massive scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We now deliver services to over 60 million locations globally and have managed over 3 billion devices on our platform. We’re expanding rapidly, pioneering a new category, and we achieved our Series F funding in just four years. Our customers include many of the world&#39;s largest Internet Service Providers (ISPs) who look to Plume to help them evolve their smart home offerings while gleaning insights from their own data.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;With a bias for action and a love for being trailblazers, the team at Plume embodies a combination of relentless curiosity and imaginative innovation. We challenge ourselves to think in ways that other companies don&#39;t, work to do what should be done (rather than what can), and if we can’t do it exceptionally well, we don’t do it. It’s how we&#39;ve assembled a team of world-class builders, thinkers, and doers. And it’s how we’re reinventing what’s possible every day.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Role Description:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a CXT Testing Intern to join the Integration department for a hands-on internship focused on software testing and integration quality. &lt;br&gt;You&#39;ll work directly with our engineers to test real, production-facing integrations, learn how testing fits into the broader software development lifecycle, and contribute meaningfully to the reliability of our platform — all while building foundational skills for a future engineering or QA career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a great opportunity for a student or early-career learner who is curious about software quality, APIs, and how large systems connect to one another.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Responsibilites:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute functional and regression test cases under the guidance of senior team members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help identify, document, and track defects using our bug tracking tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn to write and maintain basic automated test scripts as part of a guided project&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore how integrations connect our platform to third-party systems (APIs, webhooks) and test these connections&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shadow engineers during test planning and release validation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help maintain test documentation and internal knowledge base articles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in team standups, sprint planning, and retros to learn how an engineering team operates day to day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present a final project or summary of your work at the end of the internship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently pursuing a degree in Computer Science, Information Systems, Engineering, or a related field in Slovenia&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic exposure to programming or scripting (coursework, personal projects, or bootcamps all count)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity about how software systems are tested and integrated&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail and a willingness to ask questions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear written communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-to-Haves:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with any programming language (Python, JavaScript, Java, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to tools like Postman, Jira, or basic SQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior internship or project experience in a tech environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Plume&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;As the creator of the only open, hardware-independent, cloud-controlled experience platform for ISPs and their subscribers, Plume partners with over 400 ISP customers, including some of the world’s largest such as Charter, Liberty Global, and J:COM.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Using OpenSync, the most widely supported open-source, silicon-to-cloud framework for smart spaces, Plume’s software-defined network allows ISPs to decouple their service offerings from hardware and rapidly curate and deliver new services over a multi-vendor, open-platform architecture.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Plume is an equal opportunity workplace that maintains a continuing policy of nondiscrimination in all employment practices and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;decisions, ensuring equal employment opportunities for all qualified individuals without regard to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;race, color, creed, religion, sex, national origin, age, physical or mental disability, sexual &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;orientation, gender identity, marital status, pregnancy, childbirth or related individual conditions, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;medical conditions (as defined by state law), military or veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local law. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-0yr2pp3:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h1 class=&quot;section-header section-header--large font-primary&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;About Digital Asset &amp;amp; the Canton Network&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Digital Asset builds the technologies that are reshaping the foundations of financial markets. Our mission is to create the world’s most trusted, privacy-enabled, and interoperable digital infrastructure for global finance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At the heart of this mission is the Canton Network - the blockchain purpose-built for institutional finance. Uniquely combining privacy, compliance, and scalability, Canton enables real-time, secure settlement across multiple asset classes. Governed by the Canton Foundation with participation from leading financial institutions, it is the proven link between the promise of blockchain and the power of global finance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2014 and headquartered in New York City, with offices in London, Zurich, Budapest, Hong Kong, and Sydney— we are on a mission to transform finance— and that transformation is now playing out rapidly on the Canton Network.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you’re interested in playing a crucial role at the intersection of traditional and crypto-capital markets and want to help bring the next trillion dollars of finance on-chain, join us.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Talent Acquisition Coordinator is the operational and administrative expert supporting the recruiting team. As a steward of our brand, this member of our team is responsible for ensuring a well-organized recruiting experience for internal clients and candidates. Candidates will point to historical and differentiated success driving operational processes in a&amp;nbsp; high-volume, fast-moving and intense environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinates with the internal recruiting team to post positions and set up roles in our Greenhouse&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is a vital part of the candidate experience, ensuring timely communication throughout the interview process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Schedules - and reschedules, as necessary - virtual and in-person interviews between active candidates and interviewers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aligns with each specific office location as to any on-site interviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Addresses questions from either candidates or hiring teams regarding scheduling, status, testing, or issues related to the role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rejects candidates using provided templates as aligned with the point of the interview process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supports Talent Acquisition Partners with sourcing, reviewing, interviewing, etc., as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Takes on additional duties/responsibilities from time to time, as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications and Characteristics:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3-5&amp;nbsp; years of experience coordinating the recruitment process for a large-volume hiring team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable and capable in understanding of scheduling across multiple time zones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills; comfortable speaking effectively with senior stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-starter, comfortable asking questions, and with a sincere interest in understanding the environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized; pays close attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent time management and strong ability to multitask&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong verbal and written communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with Greenhouse&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient with Google Suite; able to learn new systems quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent interpersonal skills and the ability to interact with professionals at all levels, both internally and externally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creative and proactive approach to problem-solving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing to take ownership of a wide range of responsibilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The range below may vary if based outside the New York tri-state area (New York, New Jersey, and Connecticut). Base salaries are determined during our interview process, during which we assess the candidate&#39;s experience, skills, and capabilities against internal peers and the scope and responsibilities of the position.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;US Pay Transparency&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$95,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$110,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Digital Asset, we are committed to compensation structures that reward impact consistently across our global teams. We support our people at every stage of life with comprehensive, family-forward benefits and flexible working models designed to help you do your best work.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; We offer a comprehensive benefits package designed to support the well-being of our team members. Health and insurance benefits vary by region to ensure local relevance and compliance, and may include medical, dental, and vision coverage.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Digital Asset is an equal opportunity employer committed. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, national origin, sex, religion, sexual orientation, age, disability, citizenship status, veteran status, or any other basis protected by applicable law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employment Eligibility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; If and as required by applicable law, all persons hired to work at Digital Asset will be required to verify identity and eligibility to work in the location for which they have an offer to work and to complete the necessary employment eligibility verification documents upon hire.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ccommodations&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;em&gt;Applicants with disabilities who require accommodation during the application or interview process should contact &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:talent@digitalasset.com&quot;&gt;talent@digitalasset.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;California Privacy Act (CCPA)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; If you are based in California, we encourage you to read this important information for California residents linked &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.digitalasset.com/ccpacpranotice&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-1kkps7r:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;HladdPLXIoNz4nxkqkCuk4rAs8v&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XCikdRR2xoZIjdxtCKcuOflrs8d&quot;&gt;Established in 2018, Bybit is one of the world’s leading cryptocurrency exchanges and digital financial platforms, serving over 80 million users across more than 200 countries and regions. Powered by world-class technology and a user-first mindset, Bybit delivers a seamless ecosystem across trading, payments, wealth management, custody, institutional services, and Web3 — connecting users to the future of digital finance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IF06dI0MPoBwYfxbZ4zui13HsoC&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X5EbdOwvMoYuOmxQBbuueUEDsDd&quot;&gt;Our core values define how we build. We listen, care and improve to create products and experiences that put users first. Backed by a global team of ambitious builders, problem-solvers, and innovators, we foster a high-performance and fast-moving environment where talent is empowered to drive real impact at the global scale. Supported by 24/7 multilingual customer service and a strong commitment to innovation, we are shaping the future of finance through technology, collaboration, and bold execution.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LtVud2dO7oglqJxxZoOucqjJsPc&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RMHkdm4bPo66l3xMVO8ui1o8sle&quot;&gt;Today, Bybit is recognized as one of the most trusted and transparent platforms in the digital asset industry, continuing to expand its global presence while building the infrastructure for the next generation of financial services.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-zone-id=&quot;0&quot; data-line-index=&quot;0&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-zone-id=&quot;0&quot; data-line-index=&quot;0&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-zone-id=&quot;0&quot; data-line-index=&quot;0&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-zone-id=&quot;0&quot; data-line-index=&quot;0&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;RUoPdKG3CoaD0RxIxZguCyGZsAe&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XBlLddy3VoNT3txbaGNun1hrsPf&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XTFPdB4RYoK680xNvFIuZ9Cksnf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Responsible for building risk control capabilities for deposit/withdrawal and on-chain fund operation scenarios, covering core processes such as wallet transactions, signing pipelines, staking/redemption, and cross-chain bridge transfers.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RbnydLRDtoJsdKxuVS7ubMBNsdg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Design and implement blockchain transaction risk control strategies, including risk identification, rule validation, anomaly interception, and pipeline consistency assurance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-G1CfdCvGvoHI8PxfPYKuYDBpsYd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Build a risk control decision engine, supporting the implementation of rule engines, decision trees, and strategy orchestration in fund security scenarios, forming a unified risk control capability covering on-chain fund operations.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I0YddVXvKo6YETxvjfHu3EdasFd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Collaborate closely with wallet, asset, and security teams to continuously improve the security, traceability, and system stability of fund pipelines.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xy8QdLflboiyo8xzkcTush2RsFb&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P8eQd3Uxsou9Dhxe6sSuLkKXsZf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;5+ years of backend development experience; proficient in at least one of Go / Node.js; familiar with high-concurrency architecture (microservices, message queues, caching, rate limiting) and MySQL, Redis.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MUAjdTzx7oi9eExqOcWuYCK8snc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Proficient in at least one public blockchain (Ethereum / Bitcoin / BSC); familiar with on-chain querying (Web3.js / Ethers.js / The Graph); able to read Solidity contract code; knowledgeable about HD wallets, multi-sig, MPC, and other wallet technologies.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P9ccdM4LNo172IxncEIujOx5s2f&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;5+ years of risk control development experience in internet/finance/blockchain/payments; practical experience with rule engines or decision trees; has led or deeply participated in building deposit/withdrawal risk control systems.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SSMbdC9TnoPs7QxrXiIuhvmTsid&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Deep understanding of fund security; familiar with signing mechanisms, transaction validation, and security risk control solutions.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XIdFdacOUoJTnixxe1cuXrWWsxg&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EYcedI4rXoF70Fxffg8uZeHfsMg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Hands-on risk control experience at platforms with tens of millions of DAU or millions of daily transactions.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E4b3dek19oaz4SxJEKHuij2is6d&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience in emergency response to major security incidents (hacking attacks, coin theft, fund anomalies).&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AwkkdZ7g3obB7Hxd6KquSyCesyc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience building a risk control system from scratch (0 to 1).&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Bybit, we are committed to fostering a supportive and enriching work environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Our benefits include:&lt;br&gt;- Study Growth Fund: We support your professional development and continuous learning.&lt;br&gt;- Internal Events: Participate in regular team-building activities, workshops, and events designed to promote collaboration and innovation.&lt;br&gt;- Global Collaboration: Be part of a diverse, international team, working alongside colleagues from around the world.&lt;br&gt;- Career Advancement: Access opportunities for growth and advancement within a rapidly expanding global company.&lt;br&gt;- Internal Mobility: Grow with us- Your long-term development is important to us. We offer internal job opportunities to help build your career path.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-0ukeavr:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Ripple, we’re building a world where value moves like information does today. It’s big, it’s bold, and we’re already doing it. Through our crypto solutions for financial institutions, businesses, governments and developers, we are improving the global financial system and creating greater economic fairness and opportunity for more people, in more places around the world. And we get to do the best work of our career and grow our skills surrounded by colleagues who have our backs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If you’re ready to see your impact and unlock incredible career growth opportunities, join us, and build real world value.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE WORK:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior GRC Program Manager, you will support the customer security assurance program, helping Ripple Treasury customers and prospects understand and gain confidence in our security program. This role sits at the intersection of security, sales, and compliance, backing up the RFP team on security questionnaires, meeting directly with prospective customers, maintaining our security-related sales documentation, and supporting the management of customer focused DORA audits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a strong fit for a GRC-minded security professional who translates technical controls into clear, customer-ready answers, owns documentation with rigor, and can handle multiple deadlines across concurrent customer engagements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;RFP &amp;amp; Security Questionnaire Support: Serve as backup to the RFP team, completing and reviewing security questionnaires (e.g., SIG, CAIQ, and custom customer questionnaires) accurately and on deadline, and maintaining a repository of reusable, approved responses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer Engagement: Meet with prospective and existing customers to walk through the Ripple security program, respond to security and due diligence questions, and support security-related aspects of deals and renewals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Security Sales Documentation: Create and maintain security-related sales collateral, security overviews, trust center content, certification and attestation summaries, control mappings, and architecture/data-flow references, ensuring materials stay current and accurately reflect the security program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;DORA Audit Support: Assist in managing customer-initiated DORA (Digital Operational Resilience Act) audits, including coordinating audit logistics, gathering and organizing evidence, and serving as a liaison between customers and internal control owners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evidence &amp;amp; Control Coordination: Partner with control owners across Information Security, Engineering, and IT to validate questionnaire responses and gather supporting evidence when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration: Work closely with Information Security, Legal, Sales, and Customer Success to ensure consistent, accurate, and contractually aligned representation of Ripple Treasury&#39;s security and compliance posture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuous Improvement: Identify recurring customer questions and contribute to standardized responses, FAQs, and enablement materials to reduce manual effort and improve turnaround time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Risk Judgment: Recognize customer requests that may introduce security, compliance, or contractual risk, and escalate appropriately.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL BRING:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in GRC, customer security assurance, or a related security function, with hands-on experience responding to customer security questionnaires and due diligence requests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid grounding in information security frameworks including SOC 2, ISO 27001, NIST, and SWIFT, with proven understanding of core security domains such as access control, encryption, vulnerability management, and vendor risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with regulatory frameworks affecting financial services customers; direct exposure to DORA is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to translate technical security concepts into clear, business-friendly language for non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort managing multiple concurrent customer engagements and deadlines with strong organizational discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with trust center or security assurance platforms (such as SafeBase,Vanta), questionnaire automation tooling, and GRC platforms (such as Drata or LogiGate).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background working directly with financial services or FinTech customers, with familiarity with data protection and privacy frameworks including GDPR, CCPA, and DORA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relevant certifications such as CISA, CISM, CISSP, or Security+ are preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO WE ARE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Do Your Best Work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The opportunity to build in a fast-paced start-up environment with experienced industry leaders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A learning environment where you can dive deep into the latest technologies and make an impact.&amp;nbsp; A professional development budget to support other modes of learning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Thrive in an environment where no matter what race, ethnicity, gender, origin, or culture they identify with, every employee is a respected, valued, and empowered part of the team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;In-office collaboration for moments that matter is important to our culture, and we give managers and teams the flexibility to decide which 10+ days a month they come in.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Bi-weekly all-company meeting - business updates and ask me anything style discussion with our Leadership Team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We come together for moments that matter which include team offsites, team bonding activities, happy hours and more!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Take Control of Your Finances&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive salary, bonuses, and equity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive benefits that cover physical and mental healthcare, retirement, family forming, and family support&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Employee giving match&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Mobile phone stipend&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Take Care of Yourself&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;R&amp;amp;R days so you can rest and recharge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous wellness reimbursement and weekly onsite &amp;amp; virtual programming&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous vacation policy - work with your manager to take time off when you need it&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Industry-leading parental leave policies. Family planning benefits.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Catered lunches, fully-stocked kitchens with premium snacks/beverages, and plenty of fun events&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Benefits listed above are for full-time employees.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ripple is an Equal Opportunity Employer. We’re committed to building a diverse and inclusive team. We do not discriminate against qualified employees or applicants because of race, color, religion, gender identity, sex, sexual identity, pregnancy, national origin, ancestry, citizenship, age, marital status, physical disability, mental disability, medical condition, military status, or any other characteristic protected by local law or ordinance.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
