&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KBLDdDSuJoKksnxa8khlF9Regch&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong second-line oversight and challenge capabilities, with experience designing or operating risk-based monitoring, QA, issue escalation, remediation tracking, and governance processes.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQnjdLyRtowIk6xEXTblshsYgGb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong analytical and reporting capabilities, trend analysis, SLA monitoring, management information, and executive reporting.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-A0zJdtuAooWIt7xdcixl9xihgvd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to communicate clearly with regulators, Legal, Compliance, senior executives, and cross-functional stakeholders.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DThvdTek1oa2bxxEr4dl4HHTgpd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
