&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-ARMWdtKDIowwlyxaSOuuzEqssIf&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;Kpucdjv7JoAcSZxSf7PuRl5Yscb&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;At OKX, we believe that the future will be reshaped by crypto, and ultimately contribute to every individual&#39;s freedom.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;OKX is a leading crypto exchange, and the developer of OKX Wallet, giving millions access to crypto trading and decentralized crypto applications (dApps). OKX is also a trusted brand by hundreds of large institutions seeking access to crypto markets. We are safe and reliable, backed by our Proof of Reserves.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;Across our multiple offices globally, we are united by our core principles:&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;We Before Me&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;Do the Right Thing&lt;/em&gt;, and &lt;em&gt;Get Things Done&lt;/em&gt;. These shared values drive our culture, shape our processes, and foster a friendly, rewarding, and diverse environment for every OK-er. OKX is part of OKG, a group that brings the value of Blockchain to users around the world, through our leading products OKX, OKX Wallet, OKLink and more.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;PNNZdiw4Yo1ZOmx8btbucw8qsLG&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-PiRwdXFmiomeQDxx0RUuDGJ1sag&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NrSYd8kjeoNTrexRDNsuNpZOsMd&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;ATjUdmmVloS3dDx07NAlL40ighf&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MY8FdM0WvovaDZxlY3JlDLcWgBb&quot;&gt;We are looking for an experienced &lt;strong&gt;HR Systems Transformation &amp;amp; Technical PMO Manager / Senior Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to drive the implementation and governance of global HR technology initiatives.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T5BQdXYB7oGRykxvxm7lfRkSgig&quot;&gt;This is not a traditional HRIS Business Analyst or system configuration role. This role will focus on &lt;strong&gt;digital&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;transformation delivery, program management, process redesign, system governance, risk management and global adoption&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S4C4dsTVXoswKoxp7qTlpZLQgcd&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate combines strong&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;digital &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;transformation and PMO capabilities&lt;/strong&gt; with practical HR systems knowledge and can work effectively across HR, Engineering, Information Security, Compliance, Legal and regional teams.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NQ1gdeOLNoEsm2xDroWukiwGs3g&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GEUbd7sWzobkyGxnNNAufQyQsXe&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-HytwdMMd1o5PQtxqi9QudDSMsWV&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;ATjUdmmVloS3dDx07NAlL40ighf&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V844dgT7gohahSx72x4l1jELgAd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Drive &lt;strong&gt;global HR technology and process transformation initiatives&lt;/strong&gt;, translating strategic priorities into structured implementation plans, milestones and measurable outcomes.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J5h9dDwaToECyvx0wh0lKWfCgld&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Manage the &lt;strong&gt;day-to-day PMO and delivery activities&lt;/strong&gt; for HR systems initiatives, ensuring project timelines, actions, risks and stakeholder decisions are actively managed.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RDaGdkD34oGCxaxftFxldRzAgCf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Partner with &lt;strong&gt;relevant stakeholders&lt;/strong&gt; to ensure HR systems and processes meet data privacy, regulatory, security and audit requirements.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RfBidLoLcoAyVNxGUfwlcii1gTe&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Coordinate &lt;strong&gt;global system rollouts&lt;/strong&gt; across HR, Engineering and regional teams, including UAT, defect tracking, implementation readiness, cutover, launch and post-launch stabilization.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ETGfdhVy6okszyxZFrZlv4p0gef&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Partner closely with Engineering to ensure HR requirements, business rules, controls and launch expectations are clearly understood and incorporated into product delivery.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BJ9UdphcSoc9kXxvN69lSKP3gXb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Review existing HR processes and identify opportunities to &lt;strong&gt;simplify, standardize and automate workflows&lt;/strong&gt; before introducing new technology.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-G1CRdapg9oPj3OxEYa9lFHuigBe&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Develop and maintain &lt;strong&gt;HR system governance frameworks&lt;/strong&gt;, including role-based access controls, permission matrices, approval structures and access review processes.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-L5P4d4YGfosj14xytEulmXZCgsh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Partner with &lt;strong&gt;relevant stakeholders&lt;/strong&gt; to ensure HR systems and processes meet data privacy, regulatory, security and audit requirements.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WSGDdmK92ozlCGxyxGTlpWd0gwe&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Maintain strong &lt;strong&gt;change-control, documentation and governance standards&lt;/strong&gt; for system enhancements and process changes.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UZ0cdtDuzoEpmLxvD56lfUvbg8Z&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Support the design and rollout of &lt;strong&gt;automation and AI-enabled HR processes&lt;/strong&gt;, identifying where policies, compliance requirements, approvals, controls, and human intervention need to be embedded within the employee journey.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C68FdwFsLo5LYrxvaKolmE2Sgvb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Drive &lt;strong&gt;change management and adoption activities&lt;/strong&gt;, including stakeholder engagement, communication, training, and rollout support across countries and HR teams.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
