descriptions.job-000ngif:
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Stripe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies—from the world&#39;s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups—use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone&#39;s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is open to remote candidates located anywhere within the Eastern Time Zone. The Cash Platform team is part of Stripe&#39;s Money Movement Services Platform. We manage Stripe&#39;s FX and cash positions across the globe, owning two of the most commercially critical problems in our business: delivering the best possible FX trades for our users, and optimizing the cost and routing of cross-border payouts across countries. Stripe recently launched its own in-house bank, enabling near-instant movement of funds across accounts worldwide—and Cash Platform is at the center of bringing that infrastructure to Stripe&#39;s products and, increasingly, to our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work closely with engineering teams across Cash Platform and Money Movement Services, cross-functional partners spanning Legal, Treasury, Financial Crimes, and Sales, and senior stakeholders inside and outside Stripe. You&#39;ll define the strategy and roadmap for Stripe&#39;s FX and cross-border payout products, drive cost optimization and routing decisions at scale, and help shape the path toward monetizing Stripe&#39;s in-house banking infrastructure for users globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are expected to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deeply understand the competitive landscape and define clear benchmarks for where Stripe&#39;s FX and cross-border payout products need to be&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the product strategy and roadmap for Cash Platform, balancing near-term cost and performance optimization with longer-term platform monetization opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive API design and technical decisions in close partnership with engineering leads, ensuring our infrastructure is both best-in-class and commercially oriented&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead cross-functional initiatives across Money Movement, Sales, and partner teams to accelerate delivery and adoption of FX and payout products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage with senior customer and internal stakeholders to communicate roadmap direction, surface requirements, and build alignment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own decisions directly impacting the revenue and cost profile of Stripe&#39;s money movement business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is open to remote candidates located anywhere within the Eastern Time Zone.&amp;nbsp; We&#39;re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. If you meet these requirements, you are encouraged to apply. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of product management experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technically deep:&lt;/strong&gt; You have a strong technical foundation—ideally as a former engineer or data scientist—and are comfortable owning API design decisions and understanding systems end-to-end, including what is expensive from a cost and latency perspective&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business-minded:&lt;/strong&gt; You make decisions through the lens of revenue and commercial impact; this is infrastructure, not consumer product, and you understand the difference&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional by default:&lt;/strong&gt; You thrive in environments where success requires tight coordination across engineering, finance, legal, compliance, and sales—not working in silos&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain experienced:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ve worked on FX, cross-border payments, treasury, or similar financial infrastructure at companies like Airwallex, Wise, Revolut, Payoneer, Ramp, or a major financial institution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong executor:&lt;/strong&gt; You move with speed and urgency, can manage complexity across multiple workstreams, and have a track record of shipping in ambiguous, high-stakes environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong communicator:&lt;/strong&gt; You radiate intent—partners, stakeholders, and leaders know where you stand, what&#39;s blocked, and what&#39;s coming next&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

descriptions.job-0w6znvb:
&lt;h2&gt;Who we are&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About Stripe&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies—from the world&#39;s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups—use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone&#39;s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About the team&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Technical Account Managers work cross-functionally to support the largest and most complex Stripe users. Through trusted relationships, we offer customized, strategic consultations and proactively identify opportunity areas to help businesses deliver more value to their customers, optimize technical operations on their teams, and accelerate their global growth with Stripe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide a Gold Standard Experience to your assigned accounts&#39; key stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the wider Operations team to provide current state, resources, and knowledge to enable Gold Standard Experience across teams interacting directly with the user via support channels, external documentation, or product and feature feedback or development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster long-term user relationships that grow loyalty to Stripe and Stripe products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally both internally and within your user&#39;s organizations to provide and implement operational solutions on subjects not limited to fraud, disputes, declines, product adoption, and global expansion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Customer Success and other user-facing teams as part of a larger effort to support users on Stripe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead user-facing meetings both in person and through video chat&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate on the continued design of this support offering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create user-facing content for long-term solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Who you are&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. If you meet these requirements, you are encouraged to apply. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 3 years of experience in enterprise-level client-facing work in the Greater China Region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent business level Chinese as this role requires the successful candidate to work with users in the Greater China Region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong product sense and a drive to solve difficult, user-related problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to lead complex integration conversations in a highly consultative and proactive manner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with APIs and ability to explain API concepts to the largest and most technical Stripe customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with SQL and the ability to build basic queries and modify more complex ones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical troubleshooting skills and comfort interfacing with technical teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A professional, confident, and collaborative personality as an adept client relationship manager, capable of engaging in business-level and technical conversations at multiple levels of the organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An operations-savvy mindset, with the ability to identify and eliminate process friction while continuing to build scalable processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in small-to-medium-scale project management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational skills and self-starting mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with tools like Postman, Xcode, Python, Webhooks, and ETL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in the payments industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

descriptions.job-01uqk0n:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW161772177 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW161772177 BCX0&quot;&gt;Flow Traders is looking for a Staff Engineer to join us in our Amsterdam office. This is a unique opportunity to join a leading proprietary trading firm with an entrepreneurial and innovative culture at the heart of its business. We value quick-witted, creative minds and challenge them to make full use of their capacities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are looking for a senior individual contributor to lead the architectural and technical direction for our Trading Automation and Backend Engineering teams. Operating across the full trade lifecycle (pre-trade, execution, and post-trade), you will bridge the gap between engineering, trading, and operations. As a Staff Engineer, you will tackle ambiguous, large-scale problems, set global engineering standards, and scale your impact by mentoring tech leads and engineers across multiple teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW161772177 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What you will do:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW210372668 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW210372668 BCX0&quot;&gt;Strategic Architecture &amp;amp; Vision&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW210372668 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MailCompose&quot;&gt;Define and own the long-term technical architecture for our trading automation, risk, and post-trade platforms.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Translate complex, ambiguous business problems into clear, executable technical roadmaps.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Architect scalable, event-driven systems optimized for high throughput, data integrity, and reliability.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MailCompose&quot;&gt;Engineering Leadership &amp;amp; Mentorship&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate engineering standards across the organization, focusing on system design, observability, reliability, and scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as an IC multiplier: mentor senior engineers, guide tech leads, and drive technical alignment across fragmented systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead efforts to responsibly decommission legacy systems in favor of modern, scalable services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business &amp;amp; Operational Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with trading, quant, risk, and operations teams to align technical choices with business value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive automation in post-trade and middle-office workflows (allocations, settlements, reconciliations) to drastically reduce operational risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What you need to succeed&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MailCompose&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of software engineering experience, with a proven track record operating at a Staff, Principal, or cross-team Lead level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to influence senior technical and business stakeholders and drive consensus across multiple teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in building distributed, high-performance, and highly reliable backend systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency in at least one (or more) core backend language (Python, Go, C++, or Java).Experience with event-driven architectures (e.g., Kafka, Flink, Databricks, Dataproc) and data pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of modern infrastructure, observability, and cloud platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of specific financial workflows (ETF creation/redemption, clearing, custody).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with financial reference data, symbology, or instrument modeling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with regulatory frameworks (MiFID II, EMIR, SFTR) and their data lineage requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid background in financial services, trading, or market making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong working knowledge of the trading lifecycle (order flow, execution, and post-trade/settlement flows).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What we offer&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Flow Traders, we create the conditions for hard‑working, high‑performing people to do their best work. From a thorough onboarding and ongoing access to Flow Academy, to latest technology and a collaborative, non‑hierarchical culture, we give you the tools, ownership, and support to move fast and drive outcomes. We keep a close‑knit, small‑company feel while offering competitive salary, annual discretionary profit share, and comprehensive benefits,&amp;nbsp;so talent can grow here, and stay here.&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;See our benefits below:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flow Academy and opportunities to attend domain-related conferences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Daily catered lunch, great coffee, and a fully stocked kitchen and snack bar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-house Bar and Lounge with arcade, table tennis, billiards, and game consoles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company boat&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-house gym and sessions with our nutritionist or personal trainer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bi-weekly massages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual company trip and a variety of events throughout the year, such as the New Years Event&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global rotations across our offices worldwide&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;and more
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Montserrat; font-size: 10.0pt; color: #242424;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Flow Traders does not accept unsolicited resumes from any professional staffing or search firms. All resumes, and any other information identifying potential candidates, submitted to any employee at Flow Traders via-email, the Internet or directly without a valid and signed search agreement will be deemed free to contact by Flow Traders without any restrictions and no placement fee of any kind will be paid in the event the candidate is hired by Flow Traders&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
