&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/taxbit-unveils-industry-first-global-reporting-platform-bridging-digital-and-traditional-finance-302304125.html&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Taxbit Unveils Industry-First Global Reporting Platform, Bridging Digital and Traditional Finance&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/taxbit-named-to-2024-deloitte-technology-fast-500-list-of-fastest-growing-companies-in-north-america-302313123.html&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Taxbit Wins the Digital Banker’s 2025 Digital Assets Award for Best Technology Solution Provider for Digital Assets - Tax &amp;amp; Compliance Automation&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
