&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K3yXdqPsSouVRHxdAfGlvdB7gkd&quot;&gt;You will be responsible for product planning and solution design for an enterprise-grade AI Native engineering platform, driving the deep integration of AI Agents, AI Coding, knowledge capabilities, and engineering platform systems. The goal is to build an intelligent product system covering requirement analysis, solution design, development collaboration, testing validation, environment orchestration, and knowledge accumulation.This role serves complex engineering processes and multi-role collaboration scenarios. You are expected to design AI product capabilities that can be embedded into workflows, measured for impact, and continuously evolved in real enterprise environments, enabling the product to scale from pilot adoption to broad organizational rollout.&lt;/div&gt;
